<body>

<header>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">ALTAR OF FANGS · MYTHIC+ · BEAST MASTERY HUNTER</div>
    <h1><span class="cls">兽王猎人</span><span class="dot">·</span>毒牙祭坛 应对手册</h1>
    <p class="lede">开场用<b>逃脱</b>自解麻痹射击，拉维和扭缠盘蛇的长持续伤用<b>灵龟守护</b>挡在上身前。祖尔加拦完光束后，留<b>优胜劣汰</b>接切骨者，让流血清掉仪式毒液。</p>
    <div class="chips">
      <span class="chip">英雄天赋 <b>群兽领袖</b></span>
      <span class="chip">参考 <b>+22～23 限时（国 / 欧 / 美）</b></span>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<nav class="nav" aria-label="阶段导航">
  <div class="wrap"><div class="nav-scroll">
    <a href="#prep" class="on">速记</a>
    <a href="#timeline">时间轴</a>
    <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <a href="#s1">开场</a>
    <a href="#s2"><span class="n">①</span>拉维</a>
    <a href="#s3">进化者</a>
    <a href="#s4"><span class="n">②</span>盘蛇</a>
    <a href="#s5">神选者</a>
    <a href="#s6"><span class="n">③</span>祖尔加</a>
    <span class="sep" aria-hidden="true"></span>
    <a href="#talent">天赋</a>
  </div></div>
</nav>

<main class="wrap">

<section id="prep">
  <h2><span class="k">00</span>开打前速记</h2>
  <div class="cores">
    <article class="core main">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:186265}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">灵龟守护</div><div class="cd">2 分钟冷却 · 最长 8 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>偏转关键命中，开着时暂停攻击。等点名确定，再卡伤害落地前按。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:264735}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">优胜劣汰</div><div class="cd">90 秒充能 · 2 层 · 持续 8 秒</div></div></div>
      <p>龟壳庇护将减伤提高到 40%。多段伤害尽量用单层覆盖，留另一层接连波。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:109304}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">意气风发</div><div class="cd">60 秒冷却 · 即时自疗</div></div></div>
      <p>掉血后回自己和宠物，春回大地接着回 8 秒。</p>
    </article>
    <article class="core">
      <div class="top"><img class="ic lg" src="{{I:147362}}" alt=""><div><div class="nm">反制射击</div><div class="cd">24 秒冷却</div></div></div>
      <p>设焦点断自己分到的怪，多只一起读条时按分工交。</p>
    </article>
  </div>
  <div class="kicks-box">
    <div class="kicks-head"><img class="ic" src="{{I:147362}}" alt=""><h3>全本必断读条</h3></div>
    <div class="kicks">
      <a class="kick" href="#k-screech">
        <div class="meta"><span>原始毒蛇</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">刺耳嘶鸣</div>
        <div class="why">阻止全队掉血和降急速。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-envenom">
        <div class="meta"><span>高阶进化者</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">毒伤</div>
        <div class="why">提前分配毒伤打断目标。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-atrophy">
        <div class="meta"><span>扭缠盘蛇</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">剧毒萎缩</div>
        <div class="why">首领连读，轮流接断。</div>
      </a>
      <a class="kick" href="#k-mass">
        <div class="meta"><span>乌拉特克神选者</span><span class="go">跳转 ↘</span></div>
        <div class="cast">群体毒伤</div>
        <div class="why">晚段分开盯两种毒伤。</div>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="timeline">
  <h2><span class="k">01</span>一场里的防御与解控</h2>
  <p class="sub">单场实录。时间点用于对照实际冷却，按本车队的读条与分工交技能。</p>
  <div class="tl-card">
    <div class="tl-scroll">
{{TIMELINE}}
    </div>
    <div class="legend">
      <span><i class="pri"></i>灵龟守护</span>
      <span><i class="e"></i>优胜劣汰</span>
      <span><i class="v"></i>逃脱</span>
      <span><i class="muted"></i>反制射击</span>
      <span><i class="boss"></i>首领战</span>
      <span><i class="trash"></i>小怪段</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="route">
  <h2><span class="k">02</span>按路线逐段</h2>
  <p class="sub">带「必做」标签的高亮行可在战斗中速查。伤害为 +22～23 实测（含吸收），层数越高越重。</p>
  <div class="route">
    <article class="stop trash" id="s1">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>开场 → 拉维</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 仪式首领 / 原始毒蛇 / 双牙蹂躏者 / 贪婪的后裔</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>优胜劣汰盖鲜血献祭，留一层应付范围伤重叠。两层都在冷却就让治疗接献祭，缺血时用意气风发。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must" id="k-screech">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1294557}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>刺耳嘶鸣</div><div class="s">原始毒蛇读条 · 全队降急速</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:147362}}" alt="">反制射击</span></div>
            <div class="why">恶臭喷吐断不了，打断只留嘶鸣。反制冷却让队友接，落单可预投冰冻陷阱。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1294569}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>麻痹射击</div><div class="s">双牙蹂躏者点名 · 魔法持续伤与叠加减速</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:781}}" alt="">逃脱</span></div>
            <div class="why">减益一上身就朝安全方向跳，迅疾如风会连减速和跳伤一起解掉。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1306550}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">鲜血献祭</div><div class="s">仪式首领 · 全队物理直击约 38 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:264735}}" alt="">优胜劣汰</span></div>
            <div class="why">读条末交减伤，落地后的治疗吸收盾由治疗刷掉。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span>反制射击留嘶鸣，逃脱留点名。</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s2">拉维 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="stop boss" id="s2">
      <div class="node">1</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>拉维</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 1</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>三重喷吐用龟壳或优胜劣汰轮换。距盘蛇首发同步毒液至少 120 秒，才在拉维晚段再交龟壳。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1297876}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>三重喷吐</div><div class="s">点名毒球 · 直击约 66 万，随后 10 秒每跳约 21 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:186265}}" alt="">灵龟守护</span></div>
            <div class="why">球飞来时先散开，砸中前开龟壳挡直击与减益。龟壳冷却时用优胜劣汰压前几跳。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1298221}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">嘶嘶食腐</div><div class="s">吸收盾 · 狼吞虎咽接一次约 55 万，减伤后约 33 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">破盾 · 接腐肉</span></div>
            <div class="why">转火破盾，漏接会引发腐肉喷发。有层数可预开优胜劣汰接狼吞虎咽。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1307894}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">贪婪践踏</div><div class="s">全队自然直击约 74 万 · 之后掉落钟乳石</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">拉满血 · 躲落石</span></div>
            <div class="why">读条时靠近治疗覆盖区，落地后看脚下，缺血就用意气风发兜底。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1296058}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">反刍</div><div class="s">点名直线喷 3 道胃酸波 · 单次约 130–161 万，命中减速 50%、伤害降低 50%</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">走出直线</span></div>
            <div class="why">看喷吐朝向，往侧面走。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span>喷吐先散开，龟壳在毒球落地前交。</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s3">高阶进化者 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="stop trash" id="s3">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>拉维 → 扭缠盘蛇</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 高阶进化者 / 振响的扭缠蛇 / 放血者</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>反制射击按分工留给毒伤，优胜劣汰给振响。进盘蛇时尽量留龟壳，赶不上首轮就等下一个可覆盖的窗口。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must" id="k-envenom">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1289416}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>毒伤</div><div class="s">高阶进化者 · 约 3 秒读条，漏断后挂 8 秒中毒</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:147362}}" alt="">反制射击</span></div>
            <div class="why">断分工目标。反制冷却叫队友接，或用冰冻陷阱、宠物胁迫停条并盯重读。漏断上身就报队友解毒。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1294859}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">振响</div><div class="s">振响的扭缠蛇 · 无视护甲，持续 5 秒</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:264735}}" alt="">优胜劣汰</span></div>
            <div class="why">读条末开，等下一条尾巴起读再决定交另一层。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1306385}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">进化</div><div class="s">高阶进化者 · 6 秒持续回血，完成后吸收伤害并免控</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">集火进化者</span></div>
            <div class="why">盯紧血条与护盾，按队伍优先级转火。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span>盯住进化者焦点，控停后准备接重读。</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s4">扭缠盘蛇 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="stop boss" id="s4">
      <div class="node">2</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>扭缠盘蛇</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 2</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm"><span class="lbl">节奏</span>同步毒液开场约 5 秒落地，之后约每 91 秒一轮。龟壳能盖第一、三轮。若第二轮才交，第三轮进治疗覆盖。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row must">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1299189}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>同步毒液</div><div class="s">2 秒读条 · 直击约 50 万，随后 35 秒自然持续伤</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:186265}}" alt="">灵龟守护</span></div>
            <div class="why">卡第一下伤害前开龟壳，让整段减益不上身。冷却时提前进治疗覆盖，缺血用意气风发兜底。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row" id="k-atrophy">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1310358}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">剧毒萎缩</div><div class="s">剧毒弹幕中连续读条 · 叠加减伤害与移速</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:147362}}" alt="">反制射击</span></div>
            <div class="why">首领会连读，按轮次分断。分裂后也要盯溃散的扭缠蛇。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1299130}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">掘地冲锋 → 毒液喷射</div><div class="s">钻地横移 · 正面锥形单次可到约 200 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">出冲锋路径 · 绕侧面</span></div>
            <div class="why">盘蛇钻地横移时走出路径，等它现身后再避开正面锥形。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">连线时</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1299080}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">濒死喘息</div><div class="s">开怪约 50 秒起，每秒叠加物理伤害</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:1287798}}" alt="">藤蔓之握</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:781}}" alt="">逃脱</span></div>
            <div class="why">按藤蔓之握后朝外拉，背朝外用逃脱。全员离首领超过 10 码才断，先到就在外侧等。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">拉断后</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1287811}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">解除盘卷</div><div class="s">扯开连线后全队受击，约 74 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">治疗覆盖 · 转小蛇</span></div>
            <div class="why">溃散的扭缠蛇会点名追人，被点就风筝，边走边转火，尽量在同化前打掉。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span>跑路先看落点，分裂后续接打断。</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s5">祭坛利刃与神选者 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="stop trash" id="s5">
      <div class="node">怪</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>扭缠盘蛇 → 祖尔加</h3><span class="kind">TRASH · 高阶进化者 / 祭坛利刃 / 晋升之蛇 / 乌拉特克神选者</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm warn"><span class="lbl">高压段</span>优胜劣汰优先盖剧毒涌动或淬毒之刃叠伤，进祖尔加留一层。感染先分散，减伤断档时用意气风发兜底。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1308518}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">淬毒之刃</div><div class="s">祭坛利刃背刺 · 初击约 34 万，后续每跳约 17 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:264735}}" alt="">优胜劣汰</span></div>
            <div class="why">被切中且血线有压力就补开，压剩下几跳。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1308865}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">感染</div><div class="s">晋升之蛇 · 5 秒后炸周围 8 码并孵幼体</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">分散</span><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:264735}}" alt="">优胜劣汰</span></div>
            <div class="why">上身先拉开队友，减伤留到后几跳和爆炸。幼体聚拢后转火。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row" id="k-mass">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1307567}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">群体毒伤</div><div class="s">乌拉特克神选者 · 可打断读条</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:147362}}" alt="">反制射击</span></div>
            <div class="why">按分工接断；同场进化者的毒伤交给另一人。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1306852}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">剧毒涌动</div><div class="s">乌拉特克神选者 · 9 秒自然持续伤与射线</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:264735}}" alt="">优胜劣汰</span></div>
            <div class="why">首跳前后开减伤，边打边躲射线。末尾掉血时再交自疗。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span>此段后半也会带原始毒蛇，沿用开场分断。</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#s6">祖尔加 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
    <article class="stop boss" id="s6">
      <div class="node">3</div>
      <div class="stop-body">
        <div class="stop-head"><h3>祖尔加</h3><span class="kind">BOSS 3</span></div>
        <div class="rhythm warn"><span class="lbl">高压段</span>开怪前分好拦光束的人。被分到拦截就留优胜劣汰给这轮切骨者。首把切骨者约 65 秒一轮，两层都在转时，请队友接下一轮光束。</div>
        <div class="rows">
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">读条开始</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300876}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">毒牙仪式</div><div class="s">5 秒读条</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">找负责的蛇头</span></div>
            <div class="why">看到读条先到对应蛇头旁，等光束生效再挡。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">光束生效</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300876}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">拦截光束</div><div class="s">持续 8 秒</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">进自己负责的光束</span></div>
            <div class="why">站首领与蛇头之间，拦截时持续受伤并叠仪式毒液。漏拦会让祖尔加获得毒牙强化。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step">
            <div class="when">毒液在身</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1300894}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">仪式毒液</div><div class="s">光束最后一次刷新后倒计时 50 秒 · 到期会爆</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">有仪式毒液才进斧线</span></div>
            <div class="why">看切骨者点谁，优先接首把，漏接就等约 16 秒后的第二把。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row step must">
            <div class="when">飞斧将落</div>
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1301508}}" alt=""><div><div class="n"><span class="badge-must">必做</span>切骨者</div><div class="s">5 秒读条 · 直击后还有 7 秒物理流血</div></div></div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="btn-chip pri"><img class="ic sm" src="{{I:264735}}" alt="">优胜劣汰</span></div>
            <div class="why">提前约 1 秒开减伤接斧。吃到流血立刻离开脚下血池（放血），边走边等流血清仪式毒液层数。</div>
          </div>
          <div class="row">
            <div class="mech"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1301111}}" alt=""><div><div class="n">碎斧</div><div class="s">飞斧会反弹 · 实测最高约 60 万</div></div></div>
            <div class="to">→</div>
            <div class="skill"><span class="act-note">躲开反弹的碎斧</span></div>
            <div class="why">看清反弹方向再走，避开折返的路径。</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="stop-foot">
          <div class="plan"><span>光束和飞斧分别看信号，仪式毒液清完再回输出位。</span></div>
          <a class="next" href="#talent">天赋 ↓</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section id="talent">
  <h2><span class="k">03</span>天赋</h2>
  <p class="sub">群兽领袖。复制字符串，在游戏天赋界面点「导入」。</p>
  <div class="talent">
    <div class="code-row">
      <code id="talent-code">{{TALENT}}</code>
      <button type="button" id="copy-btn">复制</button>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-label">优先保留的防御与功能天赋</p>
    <div class="tal-grid">
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:109215}}" alt=""><div><b>迅疾如风</b><span>逃脱解除移动限制，用于自解麻痹射击。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:459517}}" alt=""><div><b>紧急药膏</b><span>样本中部分中毒上身后约 1～2 秒自动清除。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:459450}}" alt=""><div><b>护身软甲</b><span>优胜劣汰可存两层。</span></div></div>
      <div class="tal key"><img class="ic" src="{{I:1258485}}" alt=""><div><b>强化灵龟守护</b><span>搭配天生狂野 2/2，龟壳冷却 2 分钟。</span></div></div>
    </div>
    <p class="tal-note">常见可换：误导 / 寻路 / 开拓者，按队伍分工和跑位需求调整。</p>
  </div>
</section>

</main>

<footer>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div>兽王猎人 · 毒牙祭坛 应对手册 · 2026-11</div>
    <div class="refs">参考录像
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/j7fTprwxzG2XDPmC#fight=5">Banshers +23 28:04</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/6Lg4hCVtj12JNbXc#fight=41">丶白浅 +23 28:21</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/fAvBRtjbKxGqdMWL#fight=194">Requiescam +23 28:37</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/PkgV4X73LdKwbqcx#fight=18">Anniecpt +23 28:55</a>
      <a href="https://www.warcraftlogs.com/reports/hZDyKJzrXFcPVmdH#fight=2">Чикенмакаут +22 28:23</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script>
(function(){
  var btn=document.getElementById("copy-btn"), code=document.getElementById("talent-code");
  if(btn&&code){
    btn.addEventListener("click",function(){
      var t=code.textContent.trim();
      function done(){btn.textContent="已复制";setTimeout(function(){btn.textContent="复制";},1600);}
      function fallback(){var r=document.createRange();r.selectNodeContents(code);var sel=window.getSelection();sel.removeAllRanges();sel.addRange(r);try{document.execCommand("copy");done();}catch(e){btn.textContent="已选中，按 Ctrl+C";}}
      if(navigator.clipboard&&navigator.clipboard.writeText){navigator.clipboard.writeText(t).then(done,fallback);}else{fallback();}
    });
  }

  var links={};
  document.querySelectorAll(".nav a[href^='#']").forEach(function(a){links[a.getAttribute("href").slice(1)]=a;});
  var targets=Object.keys(links).map(function(id){return document.getElementById(id);}).filter(Boolean);
  function spy(){
    var y=window.scrollY+110, cur=targets[0]?targets[0].id:null;
    targets.forEach(function(el){if(el.getBoundingClientRect().top+window.scrollY<=y) cur=el.id;});
    if(targets.length&&window.innerHeight+window.scrollY>=document.documentElement.scrollHeight-4) cur=targets[targets.length-1].id;
    Object.keys(links).forEach(function(id){links[id].classList.toggle("on",id===cur);});
  }
  window.addEventListener("scroll",spy,{passive:true}); spy();
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
